gfx1100: the fused int8 WMMA prompt experts (upstream gates them to gfx1151 only)

The gfx11 kernel bodies are compiled for gfx1100 already; only the runtime gate kept MMQ.
hip_prefill_fused_parity passes on a 7900 XT (24 pairs, fused/MMQ <= 1e-4). Maya-S24 on
4x 7900 XT, same binary, MAYA_GLM_PREFILL_FUSED=0 vs on: prompts +5-13% at 0.2K-16K.
MAYA_GLM_PREFILL_FUSED=0 turns it off.

diff --git a/src/prefill/moe_fused_rdna4.cu b/src/prefill/moe_fused_rdna4.cu
